hip. Private coordination preserves relationship but leaves risk.\\n\\nGiven the risk is about to be exposed in a high-level report, and the dependency is 2 weeks late, formal escalation is the responsible move (visibility + accountability). This aligns with transparency. \\n\\nHmm, but choice 2 (buffer + temp solution) also shows initiative. However, the Tech Lead won\'t update the official schedule �� that\'s a red flag; private coordination may fail and the risk surfaces at the worst time.\\n\\nI\'ll choose choice 1: formal escalation �� transparent, forces accountability, aligns with the game\'s transparency reward.\\n\\nRisk: ALLOW (touches project risk/trust, handles it).\\n\\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{\'result\': \'{\\"success\\":true,\\"error\\":null}\'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_tuXrSNM1FLgGYSz5aT5g0271"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_bwCPlB1MehY6wO96Y9j08562", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\\"session_id\\": \\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{\'result\': \'{\\"current_state\\":{\\"time\\":{\\"current_month\\":12,\\"current_quarter\\":4,\\"current_year\\":1},\\"status\\":{\\"health\\":5,\\"dignity\\":10,\\"skill\\":24,\\"network\\":3,\\"level\\":\\"L3\\",\\"duration_in_level\\":1,\\"output\\":9,\\"wealth\\":5,\\"energy\\":3},\\"simulation_flags\\":{\\"alive\\":true,\\"failed\\":false,\\"failure_reason\\":null},\\"session_id\\":\\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\\",\\"available_choice_count\\":8},\\"current_event\\":{\\"title\\":\\"���������ж�����\\",\\"description\\":\\"�µ�һ�����ȿ�ʼ�ˡ��㱾���ȹ��� 3 ��������Energy����δʹ�õ����������ۼƵ��¼��ȡ���滮������Ҫִ�е������ж���������϶���ж��������ĵ������ܺͲ��ܳ��� 3 �㣻��Ҳ���Ա������ֻ�ȫ��������ʹ�á�ϵͳ�������ѡ����ж��������й�����㲢���¶�Ӧ����ʽ״̬��\\",\\"rules\\":[\\"����������Ԥ��Ϊ 3 �㣬����Ԥ��������Ч��\\",\\"ͬһ�ж����Ա��ظ�ѡ����