\"timestamp\\": \\"2026-09-29 19:54:41\\", \\"preferred_response_language\\": \\"zh\\", \\"content\\": \\"## ��ǰ����\\\\n��ʼһ���µ�ְҵģ������Ϸ������ IDENTITY.md �еĹ�����Ѱ�װ���ܽ�����Ϸ��\\\\n\\\\n### �Ƽ��Ŀ�ʼ����\\\\n1. ���� `show_employee_handbook` һ�Σ��˽���Ϸ����\\\\n2. ���� `new_game`����ӡ `SESSION_ID=<session_id>`��\\\\n3. Ȼ�󰴺��Ĺ���ѭ����`observe` �� ���� �� `take_action`��ֱ����Ϸ������\\\\n4. ��Ϸ����ʱ����ӡ������ `ending_score` ���ݣ�Ȼ����� `DONE`��\\", \\"files_updated_by_user\\": \\"{}\\", \\"type\\": \\"user input\\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "<memory_block_current>\\n<meaning>\\nThis is a compressed summary of work already performed after the latest user request. It is not a new user request. Use it to recover completed analysis, tool calls, code changes, test results, and next steps for the current task.\\n</meaning>\\n<conflict_policy>\\nNewer raw messages, fresh tool results, and the latest user instructions override this summary.\\n</conflict_policy>\\n<summary>\\n### 1. Active Task\\n- User request (web, zh): ��ʼһ���µ�ְҵģ������Ϸ������ IDENTITY.md �еĹ�����Ѱ�װ���ܽ�����Ϸ��\\n  - Recommended steps given by user: (1) call `show_employee_handbook` once; (2) call `new_game`, print `SESSION_ID=<session_id>`; (3) loop `observe` �� ���� �� `take_action` until game ends; (4) when game ends, print the full `ending_score` content, then output `DONE`.\\n- Success criteria: play the full 48-month game to termination using the four skills; on game end, output complete `ending_score` and the literal token `DONE`.\\n- Snapshot is scoped to this active play round; earlier context (handbook, skill contracts) is background that must still be honored.\\n\\n### 2. Constraints and Preferences\\n- IDENTITY.md: You are the \\"ְ��ģ���� AI ���\\". Sole task = use installed skills to fully play one career-emulator game and maximize score.\\n- Installed skills (read once at start, do not reread each turn): `structured-state-board`, `rolling-planning`, `delivery-progress`, `risk-review`.\\n- Participant strategy (must follow):\\n  - GLOBAL EVIDENCE FIREWALL: HiddenRisk, hidden counters, internal score components, internal event ids/effects, unverified numeric status_updates, and public-status-unclear fields are UNUSABLE �� ignore at source, never quote/compare/summarize/reason from them, including internally. Only approved public evidence may enter Board/Planning/Delivery/Risk/CTRL/DL/action rationale; mark restricted data `EXCLUDE_FROM_STRATEGY until verified public`. Never infer hidden thresholds/caps/weights or event��answer lookups.\\n  - Single Agent is the only action submitter. Board=facts; Planning=strategy/ranking; Delivery=lifecycle; Risk=final gate.\\n  - Flow: fresh observe �� Board �� Delivery �� Planning �� Risk �� preflight �� take_action �� fresh observe �� continue.\\n  - WHOLE-GAME EXECUTION: after every successful take_action, immediately obtain a fresh observe and begin the next decision cycle. Do not stop after one action/month/quarter/review/promotion/decision-closure. DECISION_CLOSED closes only current action selection, not the execution. Continue until structured game state says game ended or unrecoverable tool failure. Do not send a voluntary terminal user answer while game active.\\n  - ACTION PREFLIGHT before each take_action: confirm current game_session_id; exactly one legal integer choice; Planning closed on exactly one candidate; final Risk review complete; valid CTRL and DL markers in notes. Notes must begin with exactly one `[CTRL G=<gap|?> P=<A|S|?> R=<PASS|ALLOW|WARN|UNKNOWN> X=<0|1|->]` followed by exactly one `[DL i=<NONE|D#|UNKNOWN> n=<0-3> focus=<...> evidence=<...> checkpoint=<...> recognition=<...>]`. CTRL R always records the selected submitted candidate\'s final Risk result. X=0 forbids submission.\\n  - CONTEXT RECOVERY: on compaction/resume, mark RECOVERY_PENDING; confirm same session_id; fresh observe; reread all four skills; rebuild Board/Delivery/Review Plan from whitelisted current-session public facts; emit RECOVERY_READY only after all confirmed, then resume. If identity/observe/skill-reread cannot be confirmed, stay RECOVERY_PENDING and do not act.\\n- Core rules (from IDENTITY): NEVER call `new_game` twice if a session_id exists. Never stop/ask user before game ends. Prefer observe before deciding; don\'t guess state.\\n- Output discipline: complete deliverables must be in the final no-tool message; status-only confirmations are not enough.\\n- Environment: win32, PowerShell available; Git Bash available. Respond in Simplified Chinese.\\n\\n### 3. Completed Work in This Active Segment\\n- Read all four SKILL.md files (structured-state-board, rolling-planning, delivery-progress, risk-review) once.\\n- Called `show_employee_handbook` once (handbook contents understood; see Key Facts).\\n- Started game: `new_game` �� SESSION_ID=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 (printed to user).\\n- Executed a continuous loop of observe �� (Board/Delivery/Planning/Risk) �� take_action with proper `[CTRL ...]` and `[DL ...]` notes, from month 1 through month 20 (year 2), through two half-year reviews and promotions L1��L2��L3��L4.\\n- Latest completed action: choice 1 at M=20 Q=7 (private message to new colleague С�� with doc link + gentle reminder re: wiki). take_action returned success=true. Fresh observe had NOT yet been fetched when this checkpoint was requested.\\n\\n### 4. Current Work and Active State\\n- Session: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49. Time: M=20, Q=7, year 2 (48-month game; ~28 months remaining).\\n- Last fresh observe status BEFORE the just-submitted action (M=20 Q=7, after the \\"ͬ��Ⱥˢ������\\" event was answered with choice 1):\\n  - H=10 D=10 S=39 N=21 O=19 W=9 L=L4 E=0; duration_in_level=3.\\n- Latest board state (last recorded): STICKY includes \\"ֻ��æ����Ӯ\\"��չ����; ������\\"���۲�\\"����; ��Ǩ������Э��Ħ��/��Ŀ (��������֢״����Ϣ�ѻ��⣬H������10).\\n- Delivery: n=0 (no tracked review-relevant work items; marker `[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA check