s using the standard Playwright browser tools. (Tools: browser_click, browser_close, browser_drag, browser_drop, browser_evaluate, browser_file_upload, browser_fill_form, browser_find, browser_handle_dialog, browser_hover, browser_navigate, browser_navigate_back, browser_press_key, browser_select_option, browser_snapshot, browser_tabs, browser_take_screenshot, browser_type, browser_wait_for)\\n    - advanced_code: Run a preplanned Playwright code snippet only when deterministic browser tools, compact probes, evaluate, snapshot, and batch are insufficient. (Tools: browser_run_code)\\n    - unsafe_dev: Enable unrestricted browser code execution only for explicitly requested local development or debugging; this replaces advanced_code when both are requested. (Tools: browser_run_code_unsafe)\\n    - pdf: Save the current browser page as a PDF artifact. (Tools: browser_pdf_save)\\n    - vision: Use coordinate-based mouse interactions for tasks that require visual positioning. (Tools: browser_mouse_click_xy, browser_mouse_down, browser_mouse_drag_xy, browser_mouse_move_xy, browser_mouse_up, browser_mouse_wheel)\\n    - devtools: Use Playwright developer tools for annotations, highlighting, tracing, and video capture. (Tools: browser_annotate, browser_console_messages, browser_hide_highlight, browser_highlight, browser_resize, browser_resume, browser_start_tracing, browser_start_video, browser_stop_tracing, browser_stop_video, browser_video_chapter, browser_video_hide_actions, browser_video_show_actions)\\n    - config: Inspect the resolved Playwright MCP configuration when diagnosing browser runtime setup. (Tools: browser_get_config)\\n    - network: Change browser network state and add, inspect, or remove request mocks for network testing. (Tools: browser_network_request, browser_network_requests, browser_network_state_set, browser_route, browser_route_list, browser_unroute)\\n    - storage: Inspect or modify cookies and browser storage, including saving or restoring sen