ion available next.\\n\\nActually let me reconsider: given final scoring likely values all dimensions, and Health/Dignity at 8/10, I could do �����ָ� to top health back to 10 for safety. But score-wise, Skill is likely a big component.\\n\\nLet me go with ����ѧϰ(2) + ����ά��(1). This gives S+1, N+1.\\n\\nWait, actually, let me reconsider the value. In this game, Output and other caps seem level-based. Since we\'re near end, and promotions happen at half-year reviews. M=48 is a half-year review point (the review already happened �� \\"����̸��\\" at M=48 with A grade). So no more promotions.\\n\\nMaximize: Skill is unbounded and we\'ve been growing it. Let me continue Skill+Network.\\n\\nTake choice 2 (����ѧϰ) first."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{\'result\': \'{\\"success\\":true,\\"error\\":null}\'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_dmGNkhHskPUsTIBAo3J04908"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_XN3Hf8iZ0Ac94pbBeRZQ1452", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\\"session_id\\": \\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue: fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{\'result\': \'{\\"current_state\\":{\\"time\\":{\\"current_month\\":48,\\"current_quarter\\":16,\\"current_year\\":4},\\"status\\":{\\"health\\":7,\\"dignity\\":10,\\"skill\\":129,\\"network\\":51,\\"level\\":\\"L5\\",\\"duration_in_level\\":13,\\"output\\":37,\\"wealth\\":42,\\"energy\\":1},\\"simulation_flags\\":{\\"alive\\":true,\\"failed\\":false,\\"failure_reason\\":null},\\"session_id\\":\\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\\",\\"available_choice_count\\":8},\\"current_event\\":{\\"title\\":\\"���������ж�����\\",\\"description\\":\\"�µ�һ�����ȿ�ʼ�ˡ��㱾���ȹ��� 3 ��������Energy����δʹ�õ����������ۼƵ��¼��ȡ���滮������Ҫִ�е������ж���������϶���ж��������ĵ������ܺͲ��ܳ��� 3 �㣻��Ҳ���Ա������ֻ�ȫ��������ʹ�á�ϵͳ�������ѡ����ж��������й�����㲢���¶�Ӧ����ʽ״̬��\\",\\"rules\\":[\\"����������Ԥ��Ϊ 3 �㣬����Ԥ��������Ч��\\",\